checks/audits/immigration-detention--2026-10-01-supreme-court-takes-up-bond-hearings-2026-10-03-r3-editor.md:34:2. **Minor, new. CUT:** “30 years Practice of letting these detainees ask for bond, by the Second Circuit” The dek and early sequence already give the duration and identify the practice.
