checks/audits/immigration-detention--2026-10-01-supreme-court-takes-up-bond-hearings-2026-10-03-r3c-editor.md:79:7. **Major, new. CLARIFY:** “Tens of thousands of immigrants” The unqualified heading presents CBS’s disputed count as the page’s finding until the reader reaches the paragraph beneath it.
