125-§ 1225(b)(1)(A)(i), (iii)(II); see also 8 C.F.R. § 235.3(b)(1) (2025). The INA
126-explicitly requires that aliens who fall into either of these two categories are
127-subject to mandatory detention for the duration of their immigration
128-proceedings.       See INA § 235(b)(1)(B)(ii), (iii)(IV), 8 U.S.C.
129-§ 1225(b)(1)(B)(ii), (iii)(IV); see also 8 C.F.R. § 235.3(b)(2)(iii). Thus, an
